        "body": "L3HARRIS Technologies' obligations are up 26.8% year over year. L3HARRIS Technologies recorded $354M in FY26 to date compared with $279M in FY25. L3HARRIS Technologies reached a peak of $543M in FY23 before falling to $492M in FY24 and $279M in FY25."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the main agencies and markets buying from L3HARRIS Technologies?",
